  exact relay j h2 h19 d pre ticks (if Shadow.far (Shadow7.sbP (start j)) 15 z then Shadow.high (Shadow7.sbP (start j)) 15 z else 0) _ _
    high tags.1 tags.2.1 tags.2.2

